WEBVTT

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.050
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.820
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.600
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.330
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:47.040
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.620
For real? {maji...}

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.830
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:55.160
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.770
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.540
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.230
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.010
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.730
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.340
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.990
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.860
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.580
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.260
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.870
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.640
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.100
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.990
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.300
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.450
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.640
Wait!

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:52.720
What's with this X Egg?

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:53.550
What?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:56.430
Utau-chan is emptying everybody's hearts?

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.120
It's true.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:01.400
X Eggs are being mass produced!

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:05.310
Somebody must stop Utau-chan!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:10.350
Character Transformation!? Amulet Angel!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:10.350
Episode 29

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.260
I can't believe Utau's been using impromptu concerts

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.180
to steal hearts' eggs from everyone.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.900
So the increase in the number of people with empty hearts...

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.400
We can't ignore this!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.110
We have to do something to stop her!

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:29.900
Amu-chan.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:30.930
Amu-chan.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:37.580
Impossible!

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:38.850
What?

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:39.600
Why?

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.790
Even Tadase-kun cheered you on, right?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.470
I'm sure you can do it, Hinamori-san.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.350
That's true, but...

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:50.900
I couldn't do anything when I finally had an X Egg in front of me.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:54.100
With Mashiro-san around, I'm no longer...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:58.560
Besides, my own egg was marked with an X.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.990
Maybe I shouldn't be a Guardian anymore.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.600
What?

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.820
Wait!

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.060
Hold on I say!

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.130
Wh-What's going on?

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.370
You scared me!

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.860
Shut up!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.870
And you call yourself the main character?

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:13.330
Huh?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.280
This is when you're supposed to go,

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.730
"Okay! Leave it to me!"

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.420
Or some other lovely words along those lines!

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.160
Yet you immediately...

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.840
There is a limit to how unreasonable you can be!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:25.850
Easy for you to say.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.060
This was El's character?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.890
Ah... Uh-huh...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.810
Okay! You should start now!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.050
It's time for the heroine to make her appearance!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.390
It's still impossible.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.030
I'll just gorge myself on snacks and get fat!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.710
How's that for a Character Change?

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.440
Amu-chan, wait!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.240
Binge eating is bad!

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:45.460
Amu-chan!

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.310
I want to save Utau-chan!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:52.610
That's why I'm bowing my head and begging for help from her arch-nemesis!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:54.660
But you're just...

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:57.970
You know, if you're our enemy, you could just go back to Utau.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:01.890
I won't go back until Utau-chan comes for me!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.560
El.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.130
Anyway, I have no choice but to live with her arch-nemesis for now.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:08.810
Huh?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.980
Live here?

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.550
Poor little me.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:16.750
In any case, I'm calling it a day.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.120
Good night.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.270
She's so unconstrained.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.340
She's quite the incredible character.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.390
Utau.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.550
What's going on here?

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.560
Today's concert was incredible.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.180
For real. Utau-chan was so cool!

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:38.560
I absolutely worship her!

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:41.320
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.310
Uh-huh.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.860
Utau, well done.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.690
The concert today was a huge success.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.540
Lots and lots of X Eggs!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:00.930
Sanjo-san, wasn't our goal to find the Embryo?

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:06.260
Yes, and to accomplish that, we need to collect lots of X Eggs first.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.180
Huh? Really?

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.890
Rima-tan can Character Transform, too?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:40.700
Amazing.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.160
But why didn't you tell us?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.580
You didn't ask.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.550
In that case, I'm gonna ask you all kinds of stuff!

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.980
Who's your favorite entertainer?

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.340
I won't tell you.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.590
It's quite a surprise.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.990
Yuiki-san and I can only Character Change.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.290
The same goes for me.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.260
So she's the second Guardian, after Hinamori-san.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.340
Meanie.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.310
Y-Yeah.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.110
So this is where Utau-chan's arch-enemies, the Guardians, hang out.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.180
Lots of us, don't you think?

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:29.600
Today's snack of karintos and madeleines are like extreme opposites.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.600
Kukai!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.560
Yo, long time no see!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:33.510
Soma-kun!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.710
Kukai!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:35.760
Why are you here?

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.220
Were you kicked out of middle school?

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.560
Silly.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.600
I was passing through so I figure I'd drop by.

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:43.520
Did you forget that the middle school's right next door?

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.800
Zip it!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.970
Play with me! Play!

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.110
Who's that guy?

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:53.990
According to the data, he is the former Jack's Chair, Soma Kukai-senpai.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:57.170
So you guys are the new Jack and Queen, huh?

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.670
My hair's all...

00:06:58.670 --> 00:06:59.930
Salutations to you.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.140
No way! It's Daichi!

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.620
Yo, long time no see!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.520
Yay!

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:12.350
Another arch-enemy arrives at the scene.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.400
Yo, Joker!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.640
Working hard?

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:19.180
Kukai.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.680
Wh-What?

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.250
Huh? What's wrong?

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.410
Hinamori-san?

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.180
I-It's nothing.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:27.810
Well then...

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:30.400
It's almost time to patrol.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.070
We'll go with the Joker and Queen pair again today.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.560
I'll be fine on my own.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.140
Okay.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:43.410
As a special service today, I'll go with you.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.720
Ku-Kukai?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.690
That would be problematic, Senpai.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.320
My meticulously arranged schedule will be ruined.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.220
Don't be such a stiff.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.220
Well, it's been a while since we've done this...

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.180
Uh-oh.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.080
Running dash!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.850
Let's go, too!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.490
Dash! Dash!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.810
Wait!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.350
Work hard!

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.150
Help me!

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.690
Not done yet!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.120
How about it, Hinamori?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.270
You feel a lot better after moving your body?

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:15.970
Huh?

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.810
I've figured it out.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.350
You've got something on your mind.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:21.750
Let's see...

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.850
Maybe you aren't getting along with the new members?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.400
Or you have no confidence?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.430
Or you want to quit being a Guardian?

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.970
How did you know?

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.550
I can tell just by looking.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.770
Don't underestimate the former Jack's Chair.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.190
Feel free to talk to me about it.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:41.220
Kukai.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.850
Again?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.610
I'll buy you ice cream, so stop crying, okay?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.390
Yummy!

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.850
H-Heavy.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.610
And that's why you've lost confidence in being the Joker?

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:56.720
Yeah.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.380
Really.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.290
I guess I wasn't being myself.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:04.220
But I don't know what being myself means.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.380
My true character...

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.030
{aho}Dummy.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.030
Cold!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:11.570
I don't know what's considered being myself either.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.540
Really?

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.520
Sure.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:18.970
I'm struggling right now to decide if I should join the soccer team or basketball team!

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:21.310
Oh, that's all?

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.230
What do you mean, that's all?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.930
Well, you were Captain of the soccer team, so I figured...

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.700
I do love soccer,

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.720
and I've been getting invitations.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:36.100
But me automatically being associated with soccer is just an image other people have.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.600
I want to challenge myself to do all kinds of things!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.910
I don't really know what being myself means,

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.050
but it's more exciting that way!

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.640
Even when you don't know yourself?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.270
Sure.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.070
If I don't know myself,

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.640
doesn't that mean I can be whoever I want?

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:02.720
Truth is, Daichi was born when I was feeling this way.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.560
What can I do?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.720
How far can I go?

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.620
Those feelings

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.800
gave birth to my Guardian Character.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.690
Is it okay to hesitate?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.350
Okay to not really understand myself?

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.850
Sure thing!

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.470
My ice cream!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.510
Found you.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.770
Utau-chan!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:20.370
What?

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.890
What's going on?

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:25.270
Utau-chan, you've come for me, haven't you?

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:26.670
El.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:28.090
I was wondering where you'd gone.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.650
You became Amu's Guardian Character?

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.310
Enemy! Enemy!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.390
Sad.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.810
I-It's not like that!

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:36.620
Whatever. I have

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.640
a new Guardian Egg, after all.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:40.600
Dia!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:41.600
My egg!

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.470
Huh? Hinamori's?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:46.620
Yours? Aren't you mistaken?

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.340
See?

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:50.140
It's staying by my side.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.140
Dia!

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:55.810
It appears she doesn't accept you as her owner.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.810
That's why she left you,

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:01.270
and chose me instead.

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:02.660
No.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:05.150
Utau's different from the way she was before.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.310
Why?

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.960
Come on, Amu.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.310
Let's fight.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.680
Give her back.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.750
Do you want me to?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.350
Then you'll just have to beat me.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.890
I-I have no idea what's going on here.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.570
Hey, Daichi.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.290
Is it even possible to trade Guardian Characters?

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.720
I don't know. But...

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:29.280
Guardian Characters change according to the state of their owner's heart.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:32.930
That's why they end up marked by X's or shattered.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:38.880
So if a Guardian Character were to wish for a new owner, it might be...

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.890
If you win, I'll return Dia.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.220
If I win, I don't need El anyway.

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:47.270
But in exchange,

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.850
I'll take the Humpty Lock.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:51.270
Why?

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:53.350
Because I want it;

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:55.970
the lock that matches Ikuto's key.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.190
It suits me better.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.770
Go! Go!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:07.880
Hinamori!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:08.880
Don't just stand still!

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:09.660
You'll be taken out!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:10.430
But...

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.310
Amu, I like to compete.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.360
Victory and defeat are what make people improve and shine.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.420
That's why I don't need El.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:24.540
It doesn't matter if she's kind when she's weak.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.830
I only need Il and Dia.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.770
Utau-chan.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.800
That's so wrong.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:33.060
El is a Guardian Character born from your heart,

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:35.090
but you're going to abandon her just because she's weak?

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.350
My heart: Unlock!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.490
Character Transformation: Lunatic Charm!

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.600
Nightmare Lorelei!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.580
Utau-chan.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.470
What's wrong, Amu?

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.010
You want Dia, don't you?

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.850
Then fight me!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.180
But I don't want to fight!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.150
How foolish.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.580
It's not about winning or losing?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.270
Don't compete?

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.810
That's merely what adults say on the surface.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:26.850
In reality, they live by ranking and competing for everything.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:30.110
Being kind, going easy...

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:33.390
If you keep talking like that, you'll end up beaten down.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:35.720
That's right.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.550
Huh?

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:39.050
I sort of agree with that part.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.100
Sports are exciting because there are rankings.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.940
And you can improve your technique.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.320
You get the idea.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.000
You think?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.340
Wa-

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:47.640
What's with this team-up?

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:48.970
Okay!

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.450
Leave the X Egg exterminating to us!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.890
The two of you can knock yourselves out!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.190
You've gotta be kidding.

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:57.470
Hey, Hinamori!

00:14:57.470 --> 00:14:59.490
If you lose, it's twenty laps around the campus!

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:00.140
Huh?

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.140
See ya!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.680
Let's get started.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.730
I have to beat Utau,

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:12.140
or she'll take the diamond egg and the Humpty Lock.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.640
But...

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:18.690
I still don't want to fight or compete.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.100
Especially not with you.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.480
What's with that?

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.350
Why?

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.410
I like you!

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.500
You're harsh,

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.340
but it's cool how you're so straightforward.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.750
You're good at singing.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.060
And you're like me in that neither of us are very social.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:31.970
Huh?

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.470
Wh-What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.720
Besides...

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:39.850
There's a weak but kind you deep inside.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.830
Amu-chan.

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:45.460
Huh?

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.640
What's going on?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.140
Could this be...

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.020
My heart: Unlock?

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.180
A Character Transformation with El?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.180
What's this light?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.470
Character Transformation: Amulet Angel!

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.600
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:31.590
Why did I Character Transform?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.540
My heart was unlocked, too?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.220
Calm down, Kukai!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:38.890
What is this?

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.750
This light...

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:45.070
The sight of it is sending strange power through me.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.930
Amu-chan, that girl!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.080
It's the diamond Guardian Character!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.870
But she's marked with an X!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.620
My heart: Unlock.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.850
Character Transformation: Dark Jewel.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.000
I was given the boot!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.730
Amu-chan and El!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.040
Kukai and Daichi!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.470
Utau-chan and Dia!

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.720
All three of them Character Transformed!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.940
I did it! My first Character Transformation!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:36.810
I don't know why it was with Amu-chan, but I'm still happy!

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.890
Could this be the power of the Humpty Lock?

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.770
This is Character Transformation?

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:42.770
Incredible!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.550
I'm bursting with power!

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:45.620
Woo-hoo!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.700
I can feel

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.270
Dark Jewel's power.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.120
Shining Black!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.220
Come on, Amu!

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.350
Let's fight!

00:17:58.350 --> 00:17:59.120
El!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.950
Don't we have some kind of skill we can use?

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.140
Y-Yes!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:06.810
White Flag!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.350
A white flag?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.590
Unconditional surrender?

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:12.060
We lose?

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.540
Hey, El!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:16.770
I just can't fight with Utau-chan!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.260
I can't believe this.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.220
I guess El will always be El.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.390
I'll finish you now.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:27.430
Utau-chan.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:34.600
Huh?

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.220
You okay, Hinamori?

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:49.270
Amu-chan!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.520
Are you okay?

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:53.900
What happened?

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.400
I suddenly feel so weak.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.280
Your battery ran out.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:57.890
Huh?

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.080
Ikuto!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.850
Good effort on that intense duel.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.810
Ikuto, were you watching the whole time?

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.440
Not really.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.930
I just happened to be passing by.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.520
Here.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.240
Compensation.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.020
Utau made you drop yours, right?

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.060
Whoa, it's ice cream!

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:19.780
Why?

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.520
Hey, an ice pop.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.420
For real?

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:26.970
Is this to replace the ice cream we dropped earlier?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.780
Correct!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.930
He's missing the point, as usual.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.470
Sorry.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.890
Why are you apologizing?

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.710
What do you mean, why?

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:38.780
You apologize, too.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.620
No.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.770
Just say it.

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:41.640
No way.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.230
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.560
Utau.

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:48.390
Jeez, why are you on Amu's side?

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.470
Idiot!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.400
Jeez!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:52.780
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.260
Ouch.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.060
Stupid Ikuto!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.060
Hey, wait a sec.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:55.200
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:55.200
Jeez, stupid!

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.830
Sh-She like...

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:57.970
Snapped.

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:00.440
Why is it always Amu?

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.350
You know how I feel!

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.350
How you feel?

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:08.290
What?!

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.600
The grown-up world!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.140
Hey, Utau!

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.720
Cut it out!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.850
I'm getting pissed!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:18.770
But...

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.770
We're siblings!

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:23.170
Sib...

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.120
...lings?

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.220
What?!

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.080
Brother?

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.860
Sister?

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.590
Yeah.

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:30.590
Got a problem with that?

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:32.960
My real name is Tsukiyomi Utau.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.080
Ikuto's little sister by blood.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.430
Despite that, my feelings for Ikuto are stronger than anyone else's!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.220
So why is it always you?

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:47.930
Ikuto's never been this concerned about a girl before.

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:54.880
Huh?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:59.100
I've always driven away any pests that came near him.

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:00.680
H-Hold on!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:03.330
There's nothing between Ikuto and me!

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:06.200
How heartless.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.280
After we went on a date to the amusement park at night...

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:09.880
Huh?

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.680
Wait!

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.680
Unforgivable.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:13.680
Huh?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.100
I'll never lose to you!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:19.930
Let's go, Yoru.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:21.020
Yeah-nya.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:22.860
Ah, Ikuto!

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:25.100
Don't leave me behind!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.460
You sure have it rough.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.940
I'm exhausted.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:36.810
Too many things happened today.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.250
You okay?

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:42.810
A Character Transformation with someone who isn't my owner uses lots of energy.

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:48.280
In any case, it sure was surprising that Ikuto and Utau are siblings.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.470
Uh-huh.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:55.930
It appears she doesn't accept you as her owner.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:59.600
Dia didn't come back.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:02.080
Is she our enemy now?

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.750
I wonder if she'll return.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.680
My Dia's marked with an X.

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:15.810
Will I be able to get her back?

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.630
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:44.010
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:50.310
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:52.550
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.500
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.830
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:05.390
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.390 --> 00:23:09.160
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:12.770
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:16.140
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:20.050
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:23.300
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:27.300
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:30.550
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:34.530
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:39.230
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.310 --> 00:23:48.240
I am first today!

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.500
I was really surprised about Ikuto and Utau.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:55.720
It's just been incident after incident lately.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:58.470
But Kukai cheered me up.

00:23:58.470 --> 00:23:59.850
I think I feel a little better now.

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:02.180
Amu-chan, that's more like it!

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:04.490
Hey, this is no time to be relieved!

00:24:04.490 --> 00:24:06.030
The ball game tournament is coming up!

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:07.180
Ball game tournament?

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:09.790
The whole school will be in it!

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:11.130
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:12.660
Star Class vs. Moon Class!

00:24:12.660 --> 00:24:14.020
Cheerleader Brings It On!

00:24:14.020 --> 00:24:16.310
Hooray! Hooray! Amu-chan!

00:24:16.310 --> 00:24:18.520
Okay, let's do it!
